{"4487090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystic Grove", "steam_appid": 4487090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487090/extras/7a762ef1853fa8dbb300ade8d7605265.avif?t=1773131959\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Grove is a dark first-person action RPG set in a surreal alien wilderness where magic, dinosaurs, aliens and other hostile creatures collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast forests, ruined alien structures, and dangerous open landscapes filled with towering predators and twisted entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, skill-based combat using powerful magic, melee weapons, and carefully timed attacks. Face brutal enemies ranging from raptors and giganotosaurs to surreal floating horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Mystic Grove blends dark fantasy and science fiction, creating a psychedelic yet grounded experience where survival depends on awareness, preparation, and mastery of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person action RPG combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration with progression-based map unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse dinosaur species  and alien enemies to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark psychedelic fantasy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine powerful magic attacks with close-quarters melee combat in intense, skill-based encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging fights inspired by Souls-like design, but with its own chaotic touch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer PvE experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487090/extras/7a762ef1853fa8dbb300ade8d7605265.avif?t=1773131959\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Grove is a dark first-person action RPG set in a surreal alien wilderness where magic, dinosaurs, aliens and other hostile creatures collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast forests, ruined alien structures, and dangerous open landscapes filled with towering predators and twisted entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, skill-based combat using powerful magic, melee weapons, and carefully timed attacks. Face brutal enemies ranging from raptors and giganotosaurs to surreal floating horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Mystic Grove blends dark fantasy and science fiction, creating a psychedelic yet grounded experience where survival depends on awareness, preparation, and mastery of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person action RPG combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration with progression-based map unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse dinosaur species  and alien enemies to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark psychedelic fantasy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine powerful magic attacks with close-quarters melee combat in intense, skill-based encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging fights inspired by Souls-like design, but with its ow